 "subject": "or_legislature/2025R1/HB2800",
 "title": "Changes the term \"worker leasing company\" to \"professional employer organization\" in statute to reflect the use of agreements under which professional employer organizations and client employers allocate employer responsibilities for some or all of the client employer's workers.",
